    <div style="text-align: center;">
        <h2>Entry 1</h2>
        <p>And so there I was, a young kid waiting for his time to shine. Did it come you ask? Well of course it did. But that's not the point.</p>
    
        <p>What I am trying to say is, I was once a foolish young man too. I loved riding my bike with no helmet on. Having a cola after 10:00 PM.</p>
        
        <p>What I didn't love however was throwing stones wrapped with copper wire at electrical stations.</p>


        <p>This may be hard to understand but there are such things as rules mister. You better shape up otherwise we are taking away your xbox.</p>


    </div>


    <div style="text-align: center;">
        <h2>Entry 2</h2>
        <p>"Alright pal, I've had enough of you!" is what I would've said if I wasn't so taken aback by what he was asking. Sell my dog? You want me to sell my dog to you? is what I really said.</p>
        <p>"Yes brother. It will bring peace and good will to the land if you sell me your dog."</p>
        <p>"That sounds like a good bargin my friend. How much are ya charging?"</p>
        <p>"I'll take him off your hands for 5 dollars. I need one more. It's the price I pay for my good energies and vibes."</p>




    </div>


    <div style="text-align: center;">
        <h2>Entry 3</h2>
        <p>If money could talk it would say this. Debt is not a sentence, it's economy!</p>
